<title>USA: HealthPlan Services sets div, buyback.</title>
<headline>HealthPlan Services sets div, buyback.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>HealthPlan Services Corporation said its board declared an initial quarterly dividend and of 12.5 cents per share and authorized the use of $20 million to repurchase shares.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend is payable July 14, 1997, to shareholders of record on June 27, 1997.</p>
<p>It said that it may undertake some share repurchases in 1997 but expects most will take place in 1998.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
